        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Lily, the marketing guru of All Wrapped Up, believes the universe guides us to our destiny and it appears that it’s guiding her toward a celebrity realtor. However, when she feels an unexpected spark with journalist Sean Whitlock during an interview, her heart starts to question everything. As her chemistry with Sean grows, Lily begins to wonder if he’s the true match she’s been waiting for all along.",
          "runtime": 84,
          "tagline": "Finding her sign of the Christmastimes",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "IT",
        "iso_639_1": "it",
        "name": "Italiano",
        "english_name": "Italian",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Lily, la guru del marketing di All Wrapped Up, crede che l'universo ci guidi verso il nostro destino e sembra che la stia guidando verso un famoso agente immobiliare. Tuttavia, quando avverte una scintilla inaspettata con il giornalista Sean Whitlock durante un'intervista, il suo cuore inizia a mettere in discussione tutto. Man mano che la sua chimica con Sean cresce, Lily inizia a chiedersi se lui sia il vero partner che stava aspettando da sempre.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "NL",
        "iso_639_1": "nl",
        "name": "Nederlands",
        "english_name": "Dutch",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Lily, de marketinggoeroe van All Wrapped Up, gelooft dat het universum ons naar ons lot leidt en het lijkt erop dat het haar naar een beroemde makelaar leidt. Wanneer ze echter tijdens een interview een onverwachte vonk voelt bij journalist Sean Whitlock, begint haar hart alles in twijfel te trekken. Terwijl haar chemie met Sean groeit, begint Lily zich af te vragen of hij de ware match is waar ze al die tijd op heeft gewacht.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "BR",
        "iso_639_1": "pt",
        "name": "Português",
        "english_name": "Portuguese",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Com as responsabilidades das festas de fim de ano se acumulando, Lily, dona de uma loja de embalagens para presentes, aceita com entusiasmo um encontro com um belo corretor de imóveis da região. Mas será ele o homem que a conquistará?",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Desembrulhando o Natal: O Destino de Lily"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "GR",
        "iso_639_1": "el",
        "name": "ελληνικά",
        "english_name": "Greek",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Η Λίλι πάντα πίστευε ότι το σύμπαν μάς οδηγεί στο πεπρωμένο μας. Έτσι, αφήνει να την οδηγήσει σε ένα ραντεβού με τον Όουεν. Όταν όμως γνωρίζει τον δημοσιογράφο Σον, αρχίζει να αναρωτιέται μήπως πρέπει εκείνη να πιάσει το τιμόνι...",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "FR",
        "iso_639_1": "fr",
        "name": "Français",
        "english_name": "French",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Accaparée par ses responsabilités de fin d'année, Lily, propriétaire d'une boutique d'emballages cadeaux, accepte avec enthousiasme un rendez-vous avec un séduisant agent immobilier de la région. Mais sera-t-il celui qui saura la faire chavirer ?",
          "runtime": 84,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Les fées de Noël : à vos rubans !"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "DE",
        "iso_639_1": "de",
        "name": "Deutsch",
        "english_name": "German",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Lily, die Inhaberin eines Geschenkeladens, ist mit den anstehenden Feiertagsverpflichtungen stark ausgelastet und nimmt daher freudig ein Date mit einem gutaussehenden lokalen Immobilienmakler an. Während sie sich auf das Treffen freut, bleibt unklar, ob er derjenige ist, der ihr Herz erobern wird. Die Geschichte dreht sich um die Frage, ob dieser Mann der Richtige für Lily ist.",
          "runtime": 79,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Unwrapping Christmas - Zwei Weihnachtsdates für Lily"
        }
